  "headline": "Polda Metro Jaya Updates Saturday Vehicle Tax And License Services",
  "seoTitle": "Jakarta Mobile Vehicle Tax And License Service Schedule",
  "metaDescription": "Polda Metro Jaya continues its mobile vehicle tax and driving license service operations across Jakarta and surrounding areas this Saturday.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Polda Metro Jaya is operating mobile Samsat units at 12 locations across the Jadetabek region on Saturday.",
    "Mobile driving license (SIM) services are available at five locations throughout Jakarta.",
    "These mobile units are designed to assist residents with administrative obligations including vehicle tax payments and license renewals."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Polda Metro Jaya (Jakarta Metropolitan Police) maintains a recurring schedule of mobile administrative services to facilitate public access to vehicle-related documentation. These operations, commonly referred to as Samsat Keliling for vehicle tax and SIM Keliling for driving license renewals, are deployed daily across multiple locations in Jakarta, Bogor, Depok, Tangerang, and Bekasi (Jadetabek). The availability of these mobile units is announced regularly to ensure that residents can manage their administrative requirements, such as annual vehicle tax payments and driving license extensions, without needing to visit permanent regional offices. While these services are intended to improve public convenience, authorities have previously advised residents to monitor traffic conditions and planned public events, such as demonstrations, which may affect accessibility and transit routes to these specific service locations in the metropolitan area.",
